==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/bɒp/}}
* {{audio|en|En-au-bop.ogg|a=AU}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɒp|s=1}}

===Etymology 1===
{{onom|en|title=Imitative}} of the sound made.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|colloquial|onomatopoeia}} A very light [[smack]], [[blow]] or [[punch]].

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|colloquial|transitive}} To [[strike]] gently or playfully.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2013|author=Karin Tanabe|title=The List|page=37|passage=“Better him than me,” I said while my mother fluttered her blue eyes at me and '''bopped''' me on the nose with a wooden spoon.}}

